[{"client_msg_id":"791e627c-43ff-4b6c-8dd9-d21635a57f2f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今、シミュレータがある業界で、元々の試行錯誤を全部わかってるオペレータがどれだけいるかな、という","ts":"1637239594.378400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"biF8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92968276-9b27-4dff-8275-dcc9fcc91284","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、以前の活字前提のルールが、だからってデジタル組版で最適なのか、というのもあったりなかったり","ts":"1637239548.377700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3YtR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b288a92a-6b8c-400f-ac35-3565c8ad39a3","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"普段（Vimでも）機械学習使いこなしてるmattnさんがいうと重みがある","ts":"1637239515.377100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u4H0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a143898-bb74-4973-9a63-ba9280f94a19","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"実務と研究だと基準がちがうからなあ...AIはともかく、以前の技術を受け止めたなにかに代替されるのは時代の定めというのはある...","ts":"1637239494.376400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c83277ef-27d2-4eba-8abe-634454b2734f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"最近Javaのホームページも改悪されてしまったしな(改悪とは)","ts":"1637239481.375900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vOY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3700e306-6f98-4da6-8896-82c7177039e0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今すぐダウンロー\nド\n\nじゃないと物足りないって人はたくさんいそう (調教済み)","ts":"1637239446.374700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7/Rur"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14a7f5f6-45e4-4ae0-97b1-871273e5ebd9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"イイカンジはモデルを作った人の主観なので人によっては\n\n今すぐダウンロー\nド\n\nが一番読みやすいって人も居るかもしれない。(いない)","ts":"1637239397.374000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jbd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"998738e8-301c-44de-b68d-8dbdb628b298","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"AI様の言う通り","ts":"1637239219.371800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mR1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b225091e-8a24-4d83-9295-6b265f44bd04","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"みんな、なんでそれが最適なのかハッキリわからない近未来。","ts":"1637239204.371500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VcHA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12163fe5-0798-42f0-ac9d-2d1fea8ee854","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こういうのが実用的だと認識され始めて禁則処理なんかのコードや知識が使われなくなったりするんかね。以前、データベースのインデックスを AI にやらせてみたら凄い効率的だったという論文読んだけど、職人が丹精込めて導きだした最適化手法が、バイアスだけで作られた AI に負けて価値が無くなったりすると、近未来がちょっと怖くなったりしますね。","ts":"1637239111.370700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zkw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fef8e1d8-d06c-4d2f-8849-087a3ab07b72","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"文字クラス(平仮名、片仮名、漢字)毎にベクトル化して推論か。面白い。けど学習した事ないパターンでどう動くんだろう。","ts":"1637237333.363600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmat"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a576896-d918-4e3e-a007-eaf775b673ae","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"SKK利用者のデータを解析して形態素辞書を作る研究とかできそうだなと思った","ts":"1637234369.360600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o6b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74ce01bc-a905-4857-a6be-cdd4739dd82b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/google/budoux/blob/main/scripts/train.py#L64-L77\u003e\n`pred` 関数の実装を見る限り単純な線形識別モデルっぽいので、どこまで精度が出るのか気になるところですね。とりあえずディープではなさそう。","ts":"1637221222.359200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/google/budoux/blob/main/scripts/train.py | train.py\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/google/budoux/blob/main/scripts/train.py | train.py\u003e","text":"```\ndef pred(phis: typing.Dict[int, float], X: np.ndarray) -\u0026gt; np.ndarray:\n  \"\"\"Predicts the output from the given classifiers and input entries.\n\n  Args:\n    phis (Dict[int, float]): Classifiers represented as a mapping from the\n      feature index to its score.\n    X (numpy.ndarray): Input entries.\n\n  Returns:\n    A list of inferred labels.\n  \"\"\"\n  alphas = np.array(list(phis.values()))\n  y = 2 * (X[:, list(phis.keys())] == True) - 1\n  return y.dot(alphas) \u0026gt; 0\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/google/budoux|google/budoux\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U02GD5GRJ72"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1oQ9d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA2402E2-CC3C-4931-BB31-1D3BA7772AAC","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"辞書ありの形態素解析ではなくてDNN？を利用したものなんですね！\n形態素解析みたいに汎用性はあまりなさそうですが……","ts":"1637219807.357000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lMv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2951f125-32ae-4769-9420-fb0a02806d8b","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"ぎなた読みだ","ts":"1637217038.355400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QSR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"beed213e-568f-42df-b5b6-5778687197ed","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、下手にスコアを信じると\n```あなたと\nざま (地名)```\nより\n```あなた\nとざま```\nが高スコアで誤読誘発になったりしてw","ts":"1637216066.355100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ciz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2941381b-1baf-47bc-81d0-52b62600afb2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"単なる「分割可能か否か」だけでなく、そこで分割したときのペナルティみたいなものも出せたら応用がききそうですね。たとえば\n```あなたと\nJava\n```\nと\n```あなた\nとJava\n```\nのどちらが望ましいか、行長のバランスも考慮して最適な位置を決定するとか","ts":"1637215884.354100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mff"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13215a96-5a64-4653-9137-518432f28844","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"任意幅ごとに切ったりするわけじゃなくていい感じの位置で最小単位で切っていくのね。文章の折返しとかに使いたい場合は文字幅の計算は自分でやらないとダメかな","ts":"1637215562.347300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5hSEQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4051e1d-0cde-4b57-989d-bc7a2b2043f2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"単語区切り位置推定に落とし込んでるんですね。 Vim の w/e/b 移動とかに応用できたら（実用性は分からないですが）面白そう","ts":"1637215372.346400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"star-struck","count":3,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U8R597E9H","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Htr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9683ea1a-8e8e-42f2-9ac4-e9105ed0b923","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"機械学習つかって単語で切って、その単語内に改行が入らないようにしてると推測してる。","ts":"1637213240.343700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ksq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96e0d0c6-1383-4307-bda3-a425cb03fd38","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"禁則処理のようなルールベースではなく機械学習でやっているのかな？面白そう","ts":"1637212036.342800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wDyk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fc079c9-5804-47d7-898c-b640e246b13a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはスパースな行の均等割り付けができれば…","ts":"1637209893.341900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6wC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6AF4B706-AC2B-4FB3-A5A4-93758D475005","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u0026gt; It is standalone. I